home Board·self@overlay/overlay/Board.overlay/Chart.line overlay/overlay/Board.overlay
home Chart·other@overlay/overlay/Board.overlay/Chart.lend/Chart.take overlay/overlay/Board.overlay/Chart.lend
home Board·self@overlay/overlay/Board.overlay/Chart.lend overlay/overlay/Board.overlay
home Chart·self@overlay/overlay/Board.overlay/Chart.line#2/?1 overlay/overlay/Board.overlay/Chart.line#2
home Board·self@overlay/overlay/Board.overlay/Chart.line#2 overlay/overlay/Board.overlay
